        <mxCell id="b4_e5" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#C57B7B;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=9;fontColor=#3C4858;dashed=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=8;exitX=0.5000;exitY=1.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5000;entryY=0.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b4_r5" target="b4_r6">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b4_says" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;“Something on my side isn't available. Try again in a minute.”&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DDF3EF;strokeColor=#2BB3A0;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2B45;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;dashed=0;arcSize=10;absoluteArcSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1730" y="812" width="344" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b4_note" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;No audit, no answer: the outcome is never released (e2e §8 rule 5).&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6B7583;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1B2B45;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;dashed=0;arcSize=10;absoluteArcSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1730" y="904" width="344" height="56" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="foot_never" value="&lt;b&gt;Never in any of the five&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;a phone number, a location, a carrier error string or a stack trace (02 §3, errors.py docstring);&lt;br&gt;a model's judgement — every exit is a branch in tower_policy or the audit writer (rule 2);&lt;br&gt;a fact about the line before the consent gate has passed (NOT_BOUND / NO_CONSENT come first).&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3F5F8;strokeColor=#6B7583;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2B45;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;dashed=0;arcSize=10;absoluteArcSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="974" width="1012" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="foot_other" value="&lt;b&gt;Not drawn&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;HTTP 401 at step 1 (no identity) is a transport error, not a refusal envelope;&lt;br&gt;a bug anywhere (the policy raises) → bare MCP error &quot;internal error&quot;, never a partial result (server.py:66);&lt;br&gt;is_reachable never answers from stored state on the happy path — only on a timeout (D6).&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3F5F8;strokeColor=#6B7583;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2B45;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;dashed=0;arcSize=10;absoluteArcSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1062" y="974" width="1012" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
